(5661285, 822909, 97166, '<td valign="top">A little hyper-processed, which takes any and all focus OFF the subject that the focus should be, in my opinon, on. Or, at the very least, a little more subtle in the distraction.<br/> <br/>As a photograph, it''s fine. As a nude, it''s lacking.</td>', 'A little hyper-processed, which takes any and all focus OFF the subject that the focus should be, in my opinon, on. Or, at the very least, a little more subtle in the distraction. As a photograph, it''s fine. As a nude, it''s lacking.', '2009-09-25 01:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
