(5661306, 823440, 97166, '<td valign="top">Gratuitously over-processed in my opinion.  There''s very little need to over-smooth skin in a photo of this nature, especially when it begins to affect the textures of other objects. The texture of the scarf when juxtaposed with the texture of the skin, if left with a more natural feel, could have really pushed this photo. As it is, it feels unnatural and forced.</td>', 'Gratuitously over-processed in my opinion.  There''s very little need to over-smooth skin in a photo of this nature, especially when it begins to affect the textures of other objects. The texture of the scarf when juxtaposed with the texture of the skin, if left with a more natural feel, could have really pushed this photo. As it is, it feels unnatural and forced.', '2009-09-25 01:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5661307, 823339, 97166, '<td valign="top">I like the pose, the lighting, (a touch dark), and the emotion, but then I reach that hair, and it makes me cringe.</td>', 'I like the pose, the lighting, (a touch dark), and the emotion, but then I reach that hair, and it makes me cringe.', '2009-09-25 01:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
