(5663831, 823440, 75713, '<td valign="top">Lovely model - great tonal range - a little less noise filtration would suit my taste better</td>', 'Lovely model - great tonal range - a little less noise filtration would suit my taste better', '2009-09-27 02:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663834, 823339, 75713, '<td valign="top">I like the composition - good job lighting your model''s face - a little less noise reduction on his head would suit my tastes better.</td>', 'I like the composition - good job lighting your model''s face - a little less noise reduction on his head would suit my tastes better.', '2009-09-27 02:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663836, 822899, 75713, '<td valign="top">I really like the monochrome treatment - your model''s pose is interesting and his physique intriguing :)  The bottom of his hands seem a bit cut off, perhaps he is resting them on a soft surface? Lovely lighting.</td>', 'I really like the monochrome treatment - your model''s pose is interesting and his physique intriguing :)  The bottom of his hands seem a bit cut off, perhaps he is resting them on a soft surface? Lovely lighting.', '2009-09-27 02:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663839, 823331, 75713, '<td valign="top">Your model is beautiful and I love the way you made her eyes and lips pop. It might be my monitor, but there appears to be a slight greenish hue on the subject and wall.</td>', 'Your model is beautiful and I love the way you made her eyes and lips pop. It might be my monitor, but there appears to be a slight greenish hue on the subject and wall.', '2009-09-27 02:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663840, 823306, 75713, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous baby, beautiful lighting and tiny bubbles - sweet.</td>', 'Gorgeous baby, beautiful lighting and tiny bubbles - sweet.', '2009-09-27 02:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663846, 822881, 75713, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model, a comical title, but for me, the composition would be improved if the crop was tighter on the left... my eye, (prob because I am a woman lol) gets distracted by the window, the lack of definition in the sky and the bright red object in the bottom left corner. I love the way the light and the pping enhances her lovely red hair.</td>', 'Beautiful model, a comical title, but for me, the composition would be improved if the crop was tighter on the left... my eye, (prob because I am a woman lol) gets distracted by the window, the lack of definition in the sky and the bright red object in the bottom left corner. I love the way the light and the pping enhances her lovely red hair.', '2009-09-27 02:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663848, 823368, 75713, '<td valign="top">A wonderful abstract that really holds my attention.  I appreciate your post processing.</td>', 'A wonderful abstract that really holds my attention.  I appreciate your post processing.', '2009-09-27 02:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663849, 823537, 75713, '<td valign="top">Her physique is frail but her pose is strong as if she was holding back the darkness in the upper right corner.  Your backlighting highlights the contour of her body creating movement. Kudos to your model.</td>', 'Her physique is frail but her pose is strong as if she was holding back the darkness in the upper right corner.  Your backlighting highlights the contour of her body creating movement. Kudos to your model.', '2009-09-27 02:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663850, 823408, 75713, '<td valign="top">Photographed from an interesting angle however I find it difficult to see how this photo fits in the nude category. Perhaps lighting more of the cleavage area would bring this shot closer to meeting the criteria of the challenge.</td>', 'Photographed from an interesting angle however I find it difficult to see how this photo fits in the nude category. Perhaps lighting more of the cleavage area would bring this shot closer to meeting the criteria of the challenge.', '2009-09-27 03:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663854, 822450, 75713, '<td valign="top">I like the texture in your model''s skin.. she must have been pretty chilly, you should have warmed the rocks first! (lol) An interesting take on the challenge and I gave you an extra point for creativity.</td>', 'I like the texture in your model''s skin.. she must have been pretty chilly, you should have warmed the rocks first! (lol) An interesting take on the challenge and I gave you an extra point for creativity.', '2009-09-27 03:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663855, 823243, 75713, '<td valign="top">What a precious photo and one that will be treasured for years to come   Well lit, beautifully photographed and a lovely tender moment captured.</td>', 'What a precious photo and one that will be treasured for years to come   Well lit, beautifully photographed and a lovely tender moment captured.', '2009-09-27 03:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663856, 823430, 75713, '<td valign="top">Given the challenge, this was a serendipitous moment for you.</td>', 'Given the challenge, this was a serendipitous moment for you.', '2009-09-27 03:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663858, 822019, 75713, '<td valign="top">This photo makes me smile as her tentative approach in entering the water echoes my style.  I do think that this photo is a bit of a stretch for a nude challenge and your votes will probably reflect that.</td>', 'This photo makes me smile as her tentative approach in entering the water echoes my style.  I do think that this photo is a bit of a stretch for a nude challenge and your votes will probably reflect that.', '2009-09-27 03:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663860, 823260, 75713, '<td valign="top">You have a beautiful model and her delicate features and clothing is an interesting contrast to her pose.  I wonder if the composition would be improved if the b/g was a different color?</td>', 'You have a beautiful model and her delicate features and clothing is an interesting contrast to her pose.  I wonder if the composition would be improved if the b/g was a different color?', '2009-09-27 03:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663862, 822198, 75713, '<td valign="top">At first glance I wasn''t able to see much definition in the model''s body.  When I looked at the photo from a slightly different angle I was able to see the hand resting on the floor and the position of his head.  This could be the fault of my monitor but I wonder if the impact of this shot would be stronger if the lighting was more dramatic/intense.  I also think that a tighter crop on the top and right would be a better composition for my taste.</td>', 'At first glance I wasn''t able to see much definition in the model''s body.  When I looked at the photo from a slightly different angle I was able to see the hand resting on the floor and the position of his head.  This could be the fault of my monitor but I wonder if the impact of this shot would be stronger if the lighting was more dramatic/intense.  I also think that a tighter crop on the top and right would be a better composition for my taste.', '2009-09-27 03:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663863, 823282, 75713, '<td valign="top">Well photographed, nice focus but a tad blown in the right arm (on my monitor)</td>', 'Well photographed, nice focus but a tad blown in the right arm (on my monitor)', '2009-09-27 03:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663864, 823527, 75713, '<td valign="top">I appreciate your model and I like the monochromatic treatment.  However, for a beautiful model, you''ve lost half her figure by going too high key.</td>', 'I appreciate your model and I like the monochromatic treatment.  However, for a beautiful model, you''ve lost half her figure by going too high key.', '2009-09-27 03:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663866, 823376, 75713, '<td valign="top">I enjoy abstracts and really like how you used the angular black border to define the image.  The suggestion of a nude silhouette is intriguing but arguably a bit of a stretch in satisfying the challenge.</td>', 'I enjoy abstracts and really like how you used the angular black border to define the image.  The suggestion of a nude silhouette is intriguing but arguably a bit of a stretch in satisfying the challenge.', '2009-09-27 03:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663869, 823407, 75713, '<td valign="top">A comical title and a noble attempt at exposing for under the truck - but as for meeting the challenge, nah!</td>', 'A comical title and a noble attempt at exposing for under the truck - but as for meeting the challenge, nah!', '2009-09-27 03:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663870, 823448, 75713, '<td valign="top">Very well lit and photographed but this photo creates a sense of unease in me.  The title suggests one thing, fun and recreation at the beach and the image evokes another.</td>', 'Very well lit and photographed but this photo creates a sense of unease in me.  The title suggests one thing, fun and recreation at the beach and the image evokes another.', '2009-09-27 03:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663871, 823391, 75713, '<td valign="top">A sweet little child enjoying the day.  Tastefully done and a photo that will be treasured I am sure.</td>', 'A sweet little child enjoying the day.  Tastefully done and a photo that will be treasured I am sure.', '2009-09-27 04:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663874, 823516, 75713, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model, excellent lighting and an interesting contrast between the man''s shirt/tie, the model''s expression and the lace underwear.</td>', 'Beautiful model, excellent lighting and an interesting contrast between the man''s shirt/tie, the model''s expression and the lace underwear.', '2009-09-27 04:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663877, 823323, 75713, '<td valign="top">Well, I keep coming back to this photo as it interests me for a few reasons... the position of the sword was a great idea. Had you used a skinny young woman it would not have the same appeal - the shadows and the monochrome tint add drama - this is a photo of a powerful woman who knows it.</td>', 'Well, I keep coming back to this photo as it interests me for a few reasons... the position of the sword was a great idea. Had you used a skinny young woman it would not have the same appeal - the shadows and the monochrome tint add drama - this is a photo of a powerful woman who knows it.', '2009-09-27 04:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663881, 823239, 75713, '<td valign="top">You have a pretty model and the composition is good, except you should lose the headboard coming out of her head like antennae. But it just doesn''t hold my interest either visually or thematically.  More dramatic lighting would help.</td>', 'You have a pretty model and the composition is good, except you should lose the headboard coming out of her head like antennae. But it just doesn''t hold my interest either visually or thematically.  More dramatic lighting would help.', '2009-09-27 04:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
