(5665005, 823428, 75713, '<td valign="top">This is the 5th or 6th time I have come back to this photo... I wasn''t going  to comment and just leave a score but there is so little commenting lately that I thought better of it ... OK, here goes .. what I like... the wonderful textures in the skin, both the breast and the hand ... but the photo also tells a story ... is the hand gentle?  Is the hand and the breast the same person?  I like the pping to a point - I think it lacks a pure white - was that intentional?  A decent shot that fits the challenge.</td>', 'This is the 5th or 6th time I have come back to this photo... I wasn''t going  to comment and just leave a score but there is so little commenting lately that I thought better of it ... OK, here goes .. what I like... the wonderful textures in the skin, both the breast and the hand ... but the photo also tells a story ... is the hand gentle?  Is the hand and the breast the same person?  I like the pping to a point - I think it lacks a pure white - was that intentional?  A decent shot that fits the challenge.', '2009-09-28 12:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
