(5666980, 822881, 7010, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of putting models in a industrial environment. It gives a tension between the softness and fragility of the model and the harchness of the environment. A few comments: <br/>There are too many objects included in the picture that distract attention from the model. <br/>The photo is a  bit tilted and suffers from distortions on the sides. I guess you didn''t have enough room to back up and use a little less wide angle?<br/>The colors work, I like the match between the color of her hair and the red objects. On the other hand, I wonder how the picture would look like in B&amp;W.<br/>Beautiful model, no comments here ;-)</td>', 'I like the concept of putting models in a industrial environment. It gives a tension between the softness and fragility of the model and the harchness of the environment. A few comments: There are too many objects included in the picture that distract attention from the model. The photo is a  bit tilted and suffers from distortions on the sides. I guess you didn''t have enough room to back up and use a little less wide angle?The colors work, I like the match between the color of her hair and the red objects. On the other hand, I wonder how the picture would look like in B&W.Beautiful model, no comments here ;-)', '2009-09-30 05:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5666985, 823247, 7010, '<td valign="top">Raw and confronting. Nude doesn''t always have to imply soft, lovely and tender photographs. The harsh flash works very well in this case, I think. Welldone.</td>', 'Raw and confronting. Nude doesn''t always have to imply soft, lovely and tender photographs. The harsh flash works very well in this case, I think. Welldone.', '2009-09-30 05:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
