(5668001, 823323, 104518, '<td valign="top">Takes a minute to pick out the sword, but that''s ok.  Strategic placement of the guard was amusing in an otherwise serious pic.  Looks like she has some help holding the sword; that right hand is much bigger and darker than the left. Is that some kind of flag carrier support around her hips, distracting. Got to give it complexity; lots to look at.</td>', 'Takes a minute to pick out the sword, but that''s ok.  Strategic placement of the guard was amusing in an otherwise serious pic.  Looks like she has some help holding the sword; that right hand is much bigger and darker than the left. Is that some kind of flag carrier support around her hips, distracting. Got to give it complexity; lots to look at.', '2009-09-30 17:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668009, 823260, 104518, '<td valign="top">Distract him then punch him out.  Good tactic!  Liked the white kimono with the white background. Little bit of blow out on her right side.</td>', 'Distract him then punch him out.  Good tactic!  Liked the white kimono with the white background. Little bit of blow out on her right side.', '2009-09-30 17:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
