(5668037, 823309, 104518, '<td valign="top">Basics are there but several details are wrong such as the feet are mirror images and the hands are not outstretched.  I suppose the fig leaf is to meet dpreview sensitivities, so no deduction. The reposed look of his head vs. the head on look of the original takes away from it, IMHO.  Liked the lighting and background.</td>', 'Basics are there but several details are wrong such as the feet are mirror images and the hands are not outstretched.  I suppose the fig leaf is to meet dpreview sensitivities, so no deduction. The reposed look of his head vs. the head on look of the original takes away from it, IMHO.  Liked the lighting and background.', '2009-09-30 18:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668047, 823331, 68586, '<td valign="top">such a pretty model, and the drape of semi-transparent red works well here.<br/> <br/>For me this has potential to be right up at the top but is let down by little technical details like the join of the wall to the carpet, the shadows, and probably chopping her feet off. Getting a large bed sheet or curtain taped to the wall would have given you a continuous background, and the lighting is largely practice - but you know the model still carries this shot strongly. It would be good to see more pictures of her.<br/> <br/>Still a nice shot - hope you do well.</td>', 'such a pretty model, and the drape of semi-transparent red works well here. For me this has potential to be right up at the top but is let down by little technical details like the join of the wall to the carpet, the shadows, and probably chopping her feet off. Getting a large bed sheet or curtain taped to the wall would have given you a continuous background, and the lighting is largely practice - but you know the model still carries this shot strongly. It would be good to see more pictures of her. Still a nice shot - hope you do well.', '2009-09-30 18:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
