(5669871, 823448, 2612, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tonality throughout the image. The only aspect I didn''t really agree with was her expression... maybe a little empty from my perspective. But, this didn''t hurt much because I still gave the image a 9.</td>', 'Wonderful tonality throughout the image. The only aspect I didn''t really agree with was her expression... maybe a little empty from my perspective. But, this didn''t hurt much because I still gave the image a 9.', '2009-10-01 17:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669875, 823408, 2612, '<td valign="top">I''ll like this a lot, but cannot explain why. Perhaps a sense a story when I look at it. 9</td>', 'I''ll like this a lot, but cannot explain why. Perhaps a sense a story when I look at it. 9', '2009-10-01 17:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669877, 822596, 2612, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tonality in the B&amp;W converaion and fantastic light, 9.</td>', 'Wonderful tonality in the B&W converaion and fantastic light, 9.', '2009-10-01 17:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669880, 823516, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice focus and lighting - a bright clean shot, but somehow a bit cold for me. Althought the model makes eye contact nicely she looks a bit static, perhaps needing to relax a little. Don''t know - technically very nice though.</td>', 'nice focus and lighting - a bright clean shot, but somehow a bit cold for me. Althought the model makes eye contact nicely she looks a bit static, perhaps needing to relax a little. Don''t know - technically very nice though.', '2009-10-01 17:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669888, 823537, 68586, '<td valign="top">Very simple and straightforward - the pose and composition work for me - but the lighting is a little too bright which takes away some of the contours, especially around her upper body.</td>', 'Very simple and straightforward - the pose and composition work for me - but the lighting is a little too bright which takes away some of the contours, especially around her upper body.', '2009-10-01 17:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669894, 823376, 68586, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting - a wonderfully abstract air about it and the gentle colours fit in well.</td>', 'This is really interesting - a wonderfully abstract air about it and the gentle colours fit in well.', '2009-10-01 17:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669895, 822448, 68586, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2009-10-01 17:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669911, 823282, 68586, '<td valign="top">A very interesting tension between an almost Ballet like pose giving one image of how your model might be on stage going through a classical dance - and the huge tatoo on her back which gives quite a different dynamic to the shot.</td>', 'A very interesting tension between an almost Ballet like pose giving one image of how your model might be on stage going through a classical dance - and the huge tatoo on her back which gives quite a different dynamic to the shot.', '2009-10-01 17:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
