(5669961, 823430, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good photojournalism (yeah -- that''s what it is). My main quibble is a technical one, as I can see some ugly artifacts here and there. Looks like you could have boosted the file size and gotten a better quality JPG.</td>', 'Good photojournalism (yeah -- that''s what it is). My main quibble is a technical one, as I can see some ugly artifacts here and there. Looks like you could have boosted the file size and gotten a better quality JPG.', '2009-10-01 18:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
