(5669975, 822220, 61961, '<td valign="top">I like how the rain glistens, possibly added soft focus filter?  Well done.</td>', 'I like how the rain glistens, possibly added soft focus filter?  Well done.', '2009-10-01 18:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669976, 823044, 61961, '<td valign="top">I like how even though her head is out of frame at top, one can see it in her full shadow.  Beautiful reflection; pushes the boundaries of the no-genitalia rule.  I''m also intrigued by her "missing" head in the water.  It makes for a nice balance thematically and visually.</td>', 'I like how even though her head is out of frame at top, one can see it in her full shadow.  Beautiful reflection; pushes the boundaries of the no-genitalia rule.  I''m also intrigued by her "missing" head in the water.  It makes for a nice balance thematically and visually.', '2009-10-01 18:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669977, 823247, 61961, '<td valign="top">Wow, even without the provocative title, this photo is disturbing -- in a good way.  For me it doesn''t invoke prison, however.  I somehow see him as the perpetrator covered in someone else''s blood (maybe it''s the somewhat relaxed stance).  Powerful color, exposure and theme.<br/> <br/>* back to bump up!</td>', 'Wow, even without the provocative title, this photo is disturbing -- in a good way.  For me it doesn''t invoke prison, however.  I somehow see him as the perpetrator covered in someone else''s blood (maybe it''s the somewhat relaxed stance).  Powerful color, exposure and theme. * back to bump up!', '2009-10-01 18:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669980, 823376, 61961, '<td valign="top">What a great abstract!</td>', 'What a great abstract!', '2009-10-01 18:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669981, 823424, 76335, '<td valign="top">Yes!</td>', 'Yes!', '2009-10-01 18:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669982, 823405, 61961, '<td valign="top">I really like your concept here, and the bright exposure works for me.  Attractive model, too.  What I don''t like - and sorry if this sounds crude - is the impression that there are feet sticking out of her lower orifices.  Her lines flow down until below the torse she seems sort of awkward and stumpy.  I guess she''s simply kneeling, but it takes awhile to figure that out.</td>', 'I really like your concept here, and the bright exposure works for me.  Attractive model, too.  What I don''t like - and sorry if this sounds crude - is the impression that there are feet sticking out of her lower orifices.  Her lines flow down until below the torse she seems sort of awkward and stumpy.  I guess she''s simply kneeling, but it takes awhile to figure that out.', '2009-10-01 18:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669983, 823376, 76335, '<td valign="top">Simply love it!</td>', 'Simply love it!', '2009-10-01 18:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
