(5670268, 822220, 110294, '<td valign="top">Excellent mystery. I like the sprinkles added to the subject and the lighting is perfect.</td>', 'Excellent mystery. I like the sprinkles added to the subject and the lighting is perfect.', '2009-10-01 21:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
