(5670273, 823516, 110294, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image., I like the comp and lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful image., I like the comp and lighting.', '2009-10-01 21:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670324, 823513, 88533, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge, by large. Just perfect. Love the fire effect, the model, lighting and composition, everything works here. /10</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge, by large. Just perfect. Love the fire effect, the model, lighting and composition, everything works here. /10', '2009-10-01 21:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670334, 823448, 88533, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about that piece of foreground blur, but I''m really nitpicking here, this is a very powerful and beautiful photograph in all aspects. -9</td>', 'I''m not sure about that piece of foreground blur, but I''m really nitpicking here, this is a very powerful and beautiful photograph in all aspects. -9', '2009-10-01 21:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670344, 823309, 88533, '<td valign="top">Clever and very well executed. My first impression was that this might have been topped if the right foot had been kept straight, but then I looked at Da Vinci''s original and it wasn''t straight either, except it was the left foot there ;) /9</td>', 'Clever and very well executed. My first impression was that this might have been topped if the right foot had been kept straight, but then I looked at Da Vinci''s original and it wasn''t straight either, except it was the left foot there ;) /9', '2009-10-01 22:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670359, 823298, 88533, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped tighter at the bottom, maybe work this into a square crop. The clarity, lighting and play with the water droplets is stunning. /8</td>', 'I would have cropped tighter at the bottom, maybe work this into a square crop. The clarity, lighting and play with the water droplets is stunning. /8', '2009-10-01 22:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670377, 823247, 88533, '<td valign="top">I''m nitpicking here, because the photograph is great. The light is a little harsh on the subject for my taste and overall I would have preferred an (even) darker look, maybe a less lit floor and cooler tones on the ceiling. /7</td>', 'I''m nitpicking here, because the photograph is great. The light is a little harsh on the subject for my taste and overall I would have preferred an (even) darker look, maybe a less lit floor and cooler tones on the ceiling. /7', '2009-10-01 22:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670386, 823257, 88533, '<td valign="top">I find the left foot to be a bit too brightly lit, or maybe it''s the position, but I don''t think I should be drawn to it the way I am. The edges around the hair are a little soft. (I''m nitpicking of course, this is a great photograph that leaves little else to be desired). /8</td>', 'I find the left foot to be a bit too brightly lit, or maybe it''s the position, but I don''t think I should be drawn to it the way I am. The edges around the hair are a little soft. (I''m nitpicking of course, this is a great photograph that leaves little else to be desired). /8', '2009-10-01 22:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670389, 823452, 110294, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of this comp. I think you did an outstanding job on the comp crop and lighting of this image. Keep up the awesome work.<br/>df</td>', 'One of my favorites of this comp. I think you did an outstanding job on the comp crop and lighting of this image. Keep up the awesome work.df', '2009-10-01 22:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670392, 823026, 88533, '<td valign="top">Clever and very well executed. Only nitpick I have is that I don''t see how the towel relates to all this, but then again, does it have to? Probably not. /7</td>', 'Clever and very well executed. Only nitpick I have is that I don''t see how the towel relates to all this, but then again, does it have to? Probably not. /7', '2009-10-01 22:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670393, 823503, 88533, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done, I just find the skin a bit too soft for my taste. /7</td>', 'Beautifully done, I just find the skin a bit too soft for my taste. /7', '2009-10-01 22:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670400, 823430, 88533, '<td valign="top">Ooo-oh say can you seeeee... sorry, couldn''t resist ;)</td>', 'Ooo-oh say can you seeeee... sorry, couldn''t resist ;)', '2009-10-01 22:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670403, 823260, 88533, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model and a well executed photograph, only problem (for me) here is that she is intentionally pulling away her clothing. It may have been more powerful if it had been an "accidental slip". (duct tape?) ;)</td>', 'Beautiful model and a well executed photograph, only problem (for me) here is that she is intentionally pulling away her clothing. It may have been more powerful if it had been an "accidental slip". (duct tape?) ;)', '2009-10-01 22:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670418, 823044, 88533, '<td valign="top">While I understand the considerations about posting nude photographs online, it''s also little awkward to have a headless reflection, whether it was intentionally removed or by a strange situation of lighting. Doesn''t work for me, sorry. /5</td>', 'While I understand the considerations about posting nude photographs online, it''s also little awkward to have a headless reflection, whether it was intentionally removed or by a strange situation of lighting. Doesn''t work for me, sorry. /5', '2009-10-01 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
