(5670904, 823200, 102534, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for your comments. Thrilled to get a ribbon, especially for my first attempt at nude. <br/>@Lydia, I was sweating enough with one naked girl, I would have fainted had there been two! <br/> <br/>This was a big mirror in a little studio, consequently, the softboxes, walls, ceiling encroached in the mirror. I originally thought I would be able to clone them out, but after reading the rules again, i was horrified that I couldnt. So that is why her foot is chopped off, as I couldnt use the wider shots which showed all the clutter. Here are a couple of outtakes straight out of the camera so you can see how cramped it was. <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/102534/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_825254.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/102534/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_825254.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/102534/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_825254.jpg"/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/102534/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_825253.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/102534/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_825253.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/102534/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_825253.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>Cheers, <br/>Malcolm</td>', 'Thank you everyone for your comments. Thrilled to get a ribbon, especially for my first attempt at nude. @Lydia, I was sweating enough with one naked girl, I would have fainted had there been two!  This was a big mirror in a little studio, consequently, the softboxes, walls, ceiling encroached in the mirror. I originally thought I would be able to clone them out, but after reading the rules again, i was horrified that I couldnt. So that is why her foot is chopped off, as I couldnt use the wider shots which showed all the clutter. Here are a couple of outtakes straight out of the camera so you can see how cramped it was.     Cheers, Malcolm', '2009-10-02 03:56:49.000000', NULL, 0),
