(5671455, 823376, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by K10DGuy:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> fantastic. I wasn''t allowed to vote on the nude challenge, or you would''ve gotten a Pribbon, I''m sure. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You ''weren''t allowed''? How does that happen!? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>that was a lame joke about me being under 13 years old. Never mind.</td>', 'Originally posted by K10DGuy: Originally posted by posthumous: fantastic. I wasn''t allowed to vote on the nude challenge, or you would''ve gotten a Pribbon, I''m sure.   You ''weren''t allowed''? How does that happen!?   that was a lame joke about me being under 13 years old. Never mind.', '2009-10-02 12:59:02.000000', NULL, 0),
