(5671814, 823200, 68947, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot!  I like that you have rotated the shot so that the reflection is the real focus of this shot rather than the model, herself.  The fact that her eyes are showing a different gaze in the reflection as the focus makes it appear as though she has 2 personalities.  Really well done!  <br/> <br/>I also like the fact that you''ve chosen a model who is beautiful in a lot of ways and contrary to another comment concerning her "belly" LOL...I think that one should judge the photo, not her belly. ;-)</td>', 'I really like this shot!  I like that you have rotated the shot so that the reflection is the real focus of this shot rather than the model, herself.  The fact that her eyes are showing a different gaze in the reflection as the focus makes it appear as though she has 2 personalities.  Really well done!   I also like the fact that you''ve chosen a model who is beautiful in a lot of ways and contrary to another comment concerning her "belly" LOL...I think that one should judge the photo, not her belly. ;-)', '2009-10-02 17:57:26.000000', NULL, 0),
