(5672021, 823448, 86779, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot Larus, awesome.  In fact one of the best I have seen here on DPC.<br/> <br/>I also can''t believe it when people comment on the model, it''s ridiculous and insulting.  I do wonder if you shot a large naked woman whether the same people would say, "great photo but make your model go on a diet LOL."  They probably wouldn''t because they would know how upsetting it would be, so why people think they can do it with slimmer models I have no idea.<br/> <br/>Next time do the bald eagle behind a veil with a water drop into three wine glasses, no thinking outside the box on DPC.<br/> <br/>Also great DOF usage, same as your WK39 protrait, love it!</td>', 'This is an amazing shot Larus, awesome.  In fact one of the best I have seen here on DPC. I also can''t believe it when people comment on the model, it''s ridiculous and insulting.  I do wonder if you shot a large naked woman whether the same people would say, "great photo but make your model go on a diet LOL."  They probably wouldn''t because they would know how upsetting it would be, so why people think they can do it with slimmer models I have no idea. Next time do the bald eagle behind a veil with a water drop into three wine glasses, no thinking outside the box on DPC. Also great DOF usage, same as your WK39 protrait, love it!', '2009-10-02 21:42:15.000000', NULL, 0),
