(5673260, 823448, 27482, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by senor_kasper:</b></div><hr/><i>I am not sure that you enhanced the white of her right eye though I suspect you did and perhaps a bit too much for my taste.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You assume incorrectly, the only spot editing I did on her face (and her body for that matter) was to remove a strand of hair from her cheek and a little sand from her feet.  Thx for taking the time to comment!</td>', 'Originally posted by senor_kasper:I am not sure that you enhanced the white of her right eye though I suspect you did and perhaps a bit too much for my taste.  You assume incorrectly, the only spot editing I did on her face (and her body for that matter) was to remove a strand of hair from her cheek and a little sand from her feet.  Thx for taking the time to comment!', '2009-10-03 16:22:14.000000', NULL, 0),
