(5675643, 823257, 31456, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Like, "I''d put it on my wall" like it. There are quite a few images in this challenge that have no flaws, but this one goes above and beyond - it''s not just flawless, it''s refined. You could easily sell hundreds of prints (if you haven''t already) at 24x36 (not to me, I''m broke), whereas many of the others would work as a desktop wallpaper for a few days or a week, but not really as a print.</td>', 'I really like this. Like, "I''d put it on my wall" like it. There are quite a few images in this challenge that have no flaws, but this one goes above and beyond - it''s not just flawless, it''s refined. You could easily sell hundreds of prints (if you haven''t already) at 24x36 (not to me, I''m broke), whereas many of the others would work as a desktop wallpaper for a few days or a week, but not really as a print.', '2009-10-05 14:32:42.000000', NULL, 0),
